    <string name="sec_connection">Connection</string>
    <string name="connection_help">1. Turn on the hotspot on one phone (no internet needed).\n2. Every other rider connects to that hotspot over Wi-Fi — one or several.\n3. Press Start on every phone. They find each other automatically and everyone hears everyone.</string>
