    <string name="sec_settings">Battery &amp; reliability</string>
    <string name="name_hint">Your name (shown to the other rider)</string>
    <string name="battery_opt">Battery: no limits</string>
    <string name="guide">For reliable use with the screen off:\n• Battery: set Helmet Media to “No restrictions” / allow background activity.\n• If your phone has an “Autostart” or “Background apps” setting, allow Helmet Media there (App settings).\n• Lock Helmet Media in the recent-apps screen so the system does not close it.\n• Turn off “turn off hotspot automatically when idle” on the hotspot phone.\n• If Wi-Fi keeps switching to mobile data, disable the phone’s Wi-Fi assistant / smart network switch.</string>
    <string name="perm_denied">Microphone permission is required to talk.</string>

